    │  If CoinGecko fails → contest stays LOCKED + admin alert
    │  Users: "Contest is live. Results coming soon."
    │  Admin: monitor START snapshot
    ↓ [AUTO: endsAt reached — via cron]
COMPUTING  ← nouveau statut intermédiaire visible
    │  AUTO: END snapshot captured
