    │  AUTO: settlement plan generated + executed (if policy PUBLISHED)
    │  AUTO: cards released (OwnedCardInstance.lockState suppressed)
    │  Admin: can see scoring / settlement progress
    ↓ [AUTO: after compute + settlement]
SETTLED
    │  Users: rank, score breakdown per card, rewards received, cards available
    │  Admin: read-only view, full diagnostic
    ↓ [MANUAL: admin action]
ARCHIVED  ← nouveau statut terminal optionnel
